s.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Dynamic inventory optimization for Vehicle Detail Pages (VDPs) and Vehicle Listing Pages (VLPs) with automated Vehicle schema</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Multi-department Google Business Profile setup for Sales, Parts, and Service to dominate multiple local map categories</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Targeted regional keyword clustering for competitive &#x27;make + model + city&#x27; and vehicle lease queries</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="auto-buyer-journey" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">Winning each stage of the car buyer&#x27;s search journey</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><p class="text-balance-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:125:13">Modern car buyers spend over 14 hours researching online across 18 distinct digital touchpoints before stepping foot into an automotive showroom. The search journey begins with broad model comparisons (e.g., &#x27;compact SUV with best gas mileage&#x27;), moves into local inventory discovery (e.g., &#x27;used hybrid cars under $20k in [city]&#x27;), and culminates in dealership trust searches (e.g., &#x27;[dealership name] reviews and trade-in value&#x27;).</p><p class="text-balance-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:125:13">Dealerships that rely solely on expensive third-party listing portals (AutoTrader, Cars.com, CarDekho) surrender customer relationships and endure exorbitant monthly costs. Our automotive SEO builds sustainable organic showroom traffic directly to your own domain.</p></div></section><section id="dual-revenue-funnel" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">The dual-revenue strategy: showroom sales &amp; service bays</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><div data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:170:13"><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:172:15"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:173:17"><thead class="bg-mist" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:174:19"><tr data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:175:21"><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:177:25">Dealership Department</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:177:25">Target Search Intent</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:177:25">Expected Business Outcome</th></tr></thead><tbody data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:183:19"><tr class="border-t border-border" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:185:23"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">New Vehicle Sales</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">&#x27;new [make] [model] lease specials&#x27;, &#x27;test drive [model] near me&#x27;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">Qualified showroom appointments, customer trade-in leads</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:185:23"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">Used &amp; Certified Pre-Owned</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">&#x27;used trucks under $25,000&#x27;, &#x27;certified pre-owned sedan&#x27;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">Fast lot turnover on fluctuating pre-owned inventory</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:185:23"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">Service &amp; Maintenance</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">&#x27;brake pad replacement cost&#x27;, &#x27;certified [make] oil change&#x27;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">High-margin, recurring monthly service bay appointments</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:185:23"><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">OEM Parts &amp; Accessories</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">&#x27;genuine [make] replacement battery&#x27;, &#x27;all-weather floor mats&#x27;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:192:29">Direct over-the-counter parts sales and e-commerce orders</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></section><section id="technical-vdp-seo" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">Technical SEO for dynamic vehicle inventory</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><p class="text-balance-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:125:13">Car dealerships face unique technical challenges: hundreds of vehicle detail pages are published and removed each month as cars sell. Poor inventory handling leads to thousands of 404 errors, index bloat, and wasted search crawl budget.</p><div data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:150:13"><ol class="space-y-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:152:15"><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">1</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Smart Inventory Redirects</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">When a vehicle sells, dynamically suggest comparable vehicles rather than serving an empty dead-end 404 page.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">2</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Vehicle Schema Markup</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Injecting Schema.org &#x27;Vehicle&#x27; and &#x27;Car&#x27; structured data specifying VIN, mileage, fuel type, transmission, price, and availability.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">3</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Model Research Hubs</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Creating evergreen trim-level comparison guides that retain high rankings year-round regardless of current day-to-day stock.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">4</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Department Google Profiles</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Establishing verified nested Google Business Profiles for your Service and Parts departments with distinct hours and phone numbers.</span></span></li></ol></div></div></section></div><div class="mt-14" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/PageTemplate.tsx:136:13"><div id="faqs" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:289:5"><h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:290:7">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card px-5" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:293:7" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:295:11"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex" data-tsd-source="/src/components/ui/accordion.tsx:21:3"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_3diiq_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 cursor-pointer transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left font-display text-base font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:296:13" data-radix-collection-item="">How does car dealership SEO handle vehicle inventory that changes weekly?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform du